### Personal Finance Platform - API Request Collection
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### ==============================================================================
### 1. HEALTH & METRICS (Spring Boot Actuator)
### ==============================================================================

### Check API Health Status
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Check API Info
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/info

### ==============================================================================
### 2. ACCOUNTS API
### ==============================================================================

### Get All Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts

### Get Account by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/1

### Create a New Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Investment Portfolio",
  "type": "INVESTMENT",
  "initialBalance": 25000.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Update an Account
PUT {{baseUrl}}/accounts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Primary Premier Checking",
  "type": "CHECKING",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Delete an Account
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/accounts/3

### ==============================================================================
### 3. CATEGORIES API
### ==============================================================================

### Get All Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Get Expense Categories Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?type=EXPENSE

### Get Income Categories Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?type=INCOME

### Create New Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Freelance Design",
  "type": "INCOME",
  "description": "Consulting and UI/UX design income",
  "icon": "🎨",
  "color": "#8B5CF6"
}

### ==============================================================================
### 4. TRANSACTIONS API
### ==============================================================================

### Get All Transactions (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?page=0&size=20

### Filter Transactions by Account
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=1

### Filter Transactions by Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?startDate=2026-08-01&endDate=2026-08-31

### Record New Expense Transaction (Atomically deducts balance)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": 1,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "amount": 42.75,
  "transactionDate": "2026-08-20",
  "description": "Coffee and pastries at Blue Bottle"
}

### Record New Income Transaction (Atomically increments balance)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": 1,
  "categoryId": 7,
  "amount": 2800.00,
  "transactionDate": "2026-08-20",
  "description": "Mid-month bonus"
}

### Bulk Import Bank Statement CSV (Auto-categorization & balance adjustments)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/import-csv
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="accountId"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_bank_statement.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./sample_bank_statement.csv
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Delete Transaction (Atomically reverts balance adjustment)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/1


### ==============================================================================
### 5. BUDGETS API (Monthly Limits & Overspending Warnings)
### ==============================================================================

### Get Budget Progress for Current Month (Actual Spent vs Limit & Warning Status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets/progress?year=2026&month=8

### Get All Configured Budgets for Month
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets?year=2026&month=8

### Set or Update Category Budget Limit
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "limitAmount": 400.00,
  "month": 8,
  "year": 2026
}

### Delete Budget Limit
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/budgets/1

### ==============================================================================
### 6. SUBSCRIPTIONS & RECURRING BILLS API
### ==============================================================================

### Get Subscription Summary (Monthly Burn Rate & Upcoming Bills)
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/summary

### Get All Subscriptions (Optionally filtered by ?status=ACTIVE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions?status=ACTIVE

### Create New Recurring Subscription / Bill
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ChatGPT Plus",
  "amount": 20.00,
  "categoryId": 5,
  "accountId": 1,
  "frequency": "MONTHLY",
  "nextDueDate": "2026-08-25"
}

### 1-Click Pay Subscription (Deducts balance & advances billing date by 1 cycle)
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/1/pay

### Pause Subscription
PUT {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/1/pause

### Resume Subscription
PUT {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/1/resume

### Delete Subscription
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/1

### ==============================================================================
### 7. SAVINGS GOALS & MILESTONES API
### ==============================================================================

### Get All Savings Goals
GET {{baseUrl}}/goals

### Create New Savings Goal
POST {{baseUrl}}/goals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Japan Trip 2027",
  "targetAmount": 4000.00,
  "initialDeposit": 1000.00,
  "accountId": 2,
  "targetDate": "2027-04-01",
  "icon": "🗾",
  "color": "#F59E0B"
}

### Deposit Funds to Savings Goal (Deducts from linked account)
POST {{baseUrl}}/goals/1/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 250.00,
  "note": "Bonus allocation"
}

### Withdraw Funds from Savings Goal (Refunds to linked account)
POST {{baseUrl}}/goals/1/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100.00
}

### Delete Savings Goal
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/goals/1

### ==============================================================================
### 8. CURRENCY CONVERSION & EXCHANGE RATES API
### ==============================================================================

### Get Real-Time Exchange Rates (Default: USD)
GET {{baseUrl}}/currencies/rates?base=USD

### Convert Currency (e.g. 250 USD to EUR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/currencies/convert?from=USD&to=EUR&amount=250.00

### Convert Currency (e.g. 50000 JPY to USD)
GET {{baseUrl}}/currencies/convert?from=JPY&to=USD&amount=50000.00

### ==============================================================================
### 9. ANALYTICS & REPORTS API
### ==============================================================================





### Get Spending by Category (Current Month)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/spending-by-category

### Get Income by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/income-by-category

### Get Monthly Financial Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/monthly-summary?year=2026&month=8

### Get Full Cash Flow Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/cash-flow
